      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "In this post, we show how IskayPet, a leading pet care company in Iberia, built a corporate knowledge assistant on Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Bases.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "With more than 4,500 employees and 7 million customers, IskayPet runs operations that span retail, veterinary clinics, animal care, procurement, and people and onboarding.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Why Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Bases",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "IskayPet chose Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Bases for its managed RAG infrastructure, which removed the need to run vector stores, embeddings, or ingestion pipelines.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "IskayPet built the whole solution, from the store-facing frontend to the AWS architecture and service deployment, using Kiro , the agentic development environment, running on Claude Haiku 4.5 on Amazon Bedrock.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "As new models become available on Amazon Bedrock, IskayPet plans to evaluate and adopt them for each use case.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Rather than migrate them, the team used the native SharePoint connector in Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Bases.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Bases supports this document-level access control natively, so the same answer to the same question can legitimately differ between two employees with different permissions.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "IskayPet built a production corporate knowledge assistant on Amazon Bedrock Managed Knowledge Bases that serves three countries, four languages, and several business areas, with no RAG infrastructure to run.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/machine-learning/how-iskaypet-unified-corporate-knowledge-with-amazon-bedrock-managed-knowledge-bases/",
        "source": "AWS Machine Learning Blog",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-22T18:01:53.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-23T00:37:19.972Z"
      },
      {
